            "review_title": "Review at Pho 99 Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Travelbuddy\nGermany10 contributions\n0\nDelicious\nMay 2019 • Couples\nHad my first Pho yesterday. My wife has had it before and this was my first. It was very delicious and the broth was er flavorful. I wish there was more noodles but can’t have it all. They only thing that was upsetting is that their credit card machine was broken and never mold anyone. I didn’t have cash so I had to frantically run around to find an ATM. That took 20 minutes in the rain. Also it was ridiculously hot in their but food was good.\nRead more\nWritten May 27, 2019",
