            "review_title": "Review at Pho 99 Restaurant",
            "review_text": "SwissGourmet@Taiwan\nBeitun, Taichung2306 contributions\n0\nGood Pho with fresh herbs and fragrant broth.\nJan 2019 • Friends\nI read the previous reviews here after I already ordered and I was a bit worried. But the Pho was surprisingly delicious with fresh tripe, tender beef slices, and silky beef tendons. The Omelet was packed with fragrant bean sprouts and served with plenty of lettuce and herbs. Surely I prefer the road side stalls selling fantastic Pho but if you want air-conditioning, a toilet, or just a regular chair to enjoy Pho then Pho 99 is definitely a good choice out of many.\nRead more\nWritten January 9, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
