            "review_title": "Review at Pho 99 Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Anon\n2 contributions\n0\nWaited 40 minutes to tell us the food we ordered was unavailable!\nDec 2018 • Couples\nOrdered vegetarian Pho here. After waiting around 35 minutes we asked if our food was ready. The waiter came back 5 minutes later to tell us our food was unavailable. They could have easily told us this when we ordered. They only had meat options, but I am a vegetarian. They then charged us for the two drinks we ordered, after wasting 40 minutes of our time. They were apologetic but I would not go again.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 20, 2018",
