            "review_text": "Linda L\n1 contribution\n0\nRipped us off-Poor service -mediocre food\nSep 2017 • Business\nI went there today and asked for rare beef on the side, instead they gave me rare beef in soup without noodles. Thus charging me for a new bowl of pho instead of just rare beef. They said I didn't properly state what I wanted. Why in the world would I order a bowl of pho without noodles when I already ordered myself a bowl of pho. It's clear that I wanted more meat. \n\nOut right ripped me off because I was a tourist. They never tried to clarify the situation or even tried to make the situation better. Horrible customer service. \n\nThe owners need new managers. The waiters were nice, the managers weren't.\nRead more\nWritten September 12, 2017",
