            "review_title": "Review at Pho 99 Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Peter T\nMexico City, Mexico22 contributions\n1\nGrabbed lunch here. Double check you change.\nFeb 2017 • Solo\nFood is alright and reasonably priced. Service is mediocre. I've had mixed up orders on multiple occasions. \n\nOverall even all these things I wouldn't mind.\n\nThe interesting thing my most recent visit was she had tried to not let me look at the receipt. And then after I paid it was one of the first instances I wasn't given te receipt. I actually didn't want it to double check the change but for accounting purposes.\nBut upon waiting for the receipt I realized I was short 25% of what was owed. So though in the grand scheme of things they weren't taking that much.\nShe comes back with the difference And gives me the remainder of my change without a word.\n\nInteresting situation overall. \nThe principle of it is a bit of a turn off to me continuing to come here.\nIf you do just make sure to check the change you get back.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 4, 2017",
